      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c85832ac6452e7e",
      "translationZh": "LiveCodeBench v6，仅包含中等和困难题。共 132 道题，其中 80 道困难题、52 道中等题。所有数字均按 pass@1 / pass@2 的顺序列出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a51195e67ff6495e",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B，2x 3090，原版模型和原版模板：76 / 95",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b4a2b82a2cde117",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B，2x 3090，+ LoRA + sharp 模板：91 / 110",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a38476b98e65713b",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B，3090 Ti + Strix Halo iGPU，同样采用上述两项优化：90 / 111",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00b1b6bde671ea4b",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B，仅使用 Strix Halo iGPU：82 / 106",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdf6c8bc9d6ecdcd",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.0-35B-A3B，2x 3090，原版模板：82 / 92",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eabb8be4d426267",
      "translationZh": "适配器和模板让 pass@1 多通过了十五道题，pass@2（mailto:pass@2）也多通过了十五道题。第二张 3090 只带来一道题的提升，而在 pass@2 上，结果反而倒了过来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04824a340e3dd850",
      "translationZh": "Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B 每个 token 使用 256 个专家中的 8 个。它完全在 iGPU 上运行，全程没有使用 CUDA；在 pass@2（mailto:pass@2）上，通过的题数仅比最佳双 3090 配置少四道。在 HumanEval+ 上，它的成绩是 152/164，而加载了 LoRA 的 27B 模型是 149/164，因此在这套测试中它处于领先地位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58711256c87f80ff",
      "translationZh": "GGUF 默认附带的思考模式配置，在我最先跑的测试矩阵的六个单元中全部失败。Instruct 则全部通过。检查一下你的元数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1becb35c41ad164",
      "translationZh": "持续解码速度为 46.6 tok/s。大家反复引用的这台台式机的数字是 153，我也引用过。但那个数字是在短提示词和缓存已预热的情况下测得的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50c7c7f785a1815c",
      "translationZh": "我的 pass@2 会把模型自己犯的错误反馈给它，让它重试，而不是进行两次独立采样。这个数字有用，但名字起错了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36f57e211ef8c94c",
      "translationZh": "还有人在相同权重上对聊天模板做过 A/B 测试，并实际测量过结果吗？我原以为量化方案才是关键因素。结果并不是。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "539f8cbc4e998e15",
      "translationZh": "图表和按难度细分的结果：",
